{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nA null/blank bucket is accepted and fails only during export, where the plugin catches the exception and produces no record. Non-positive size limits also silently disable truncation. Validate the required destination and positive limit before constructing the client, apply equivalent validation to CloudWatch Logs and Lambda log exporters, and add invalid-configuration tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNF-R","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"5552e218584a456db25c4a9cad7c0c4daa75443075286759adb4e1e1397ce4a5","observation_id":"aro_v1_kvjoegcyjjcw3ms4jkok27amjw","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_bbfwem7rcgmzdf2rxlpfmvh24m","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
